synopsis":"Adaeze finds the oldest harp records gone and the Founder's Fork out of tune with the Hunger Tone; Juno captures a woman with a list.","id":"R9q7bnyO2byJQKiNOiT0F","createdAt":1793092102342,"updatedAt":1793092102342,"version":1},{"notes":"","wordGoal":null,"worldId":"os-ym7EwunyTMDieuRMb1","timelineId":"PnoEuxRs-pnuhq1Nug1vk","number":14,"title":"True Pitch","synopsis":"Adaeze retunes the harp to the Fork; Juno meets Rhee on Corrie Rock; Mor listens at the door.","id":"TAMq5MS4ViaG-Dt5-v0yk","createdAt":1793092119258,"updatedAt":1793092119258,"version":1},{"notes":"","wordGoal":null,"worldId":"os-ym7EwunyTMDieuRMb1","timelineId":"ST4jdjCPlD6GmgCHSK16K","number":10,"title":"Trial","synopsis":"Corrigan flies the trial Keeping; Hesper calls it a success; the cutters of Shaft Nine down tools.","id":"_YizxoDDs2HC97Smr_hEY","createdAt":1793092107925,"updatedAt":1793092107925,"version":1},{"notes":"","wordGoal":null,"worldId":"os-ym7EwunyTMDieuRMb1","timelineId":"ST4jdjCPlD6GmgCHSK16K","number":4,"title":"The Sounding","synopsis":"Teo flies Ambrose to the mouth to drop his buoy; Hesper proposes the Keeping and offers debt release to any pilot who flies it.","id":"hWwk3SB7ZaGrEanbf4VhQ","createdAt":1793092091192,"updatedAt":1793092091192,"version":1},{"notes":"","wordGoal":null,"worldId":"os-ym7EwunyTMDieuRMb1","timelineId":"1Gt0Nmj9fSssszp28yFzc","number":9,"title":"The Choke","synopsis":"Lucan tunes the harp to the First Warden's Fork and sees what fills the throat.","id":"j1VCRiUth7uIAv2Y6xHkC","createdAt":1793092105108,"updatedAt":1793092105108,"version":1},{"notes":"","wordGoal":null,"worldId":"os-ym7EwunyTMDieuRMb1","timelineId":"PnoEuxRs-pnuhq1Nug1vk","number":17,"title":"The Inheritance","synopsis":"Juno breaks Adaeze out and they steal the Testament; Juno takes the Vigil over to the Shoals.","id":"laUnOS8dX7JALqOvwQKJL","createdAt":1793092127641,"updatedAt":1793092127641,"version":1},{"notes":"","wordGoal":null,"worldId":"os-ym7EwunyTMDieuRMb1","timeline