 a deep Narrowing; Hesper orders silence and tells him the Concern is leaving.","locationMarkerId":"yBmIaILRNsWH9U1mYNeIi","involvedCharacterIds":["Nz21WLzsyWyV5l2ZCGeph","KTf_JCAKUMQ3GKu2kixRa","kKPEd-csxdzTE5plAVRqJ"],"involvedItemIds":["VuHFhK4GdePcZFlHW2Gc2","4W7H7AXZt69yA9Bm8xOyk"],"tags":[],"id":"l5bRaZgZBxOt2ptfbKZe3","sortOrder":-1,"createdAt":1793092538530,"updatedAt":1793092609979,"version":8,"remoteCharacterIds":[]},{"travelDays":null,"inWorldTime":0,"tension":2,"structureBeat":null,"status":"draft","povCharacterId":"ba36zRukMnL6eifQ8p0Lp","isFlashback":false,"mentionedCharacterIds":[],"threadIds":["9yaD7eWlZcvjmZ6iUF8ff","eO_7QOdp0avWbvEC7OOfX"],"motifIds":["gQ_6swqJ5lW3yGhmN9POY","8CmTnO92ZbAiueYnKULWV"],"worldId":"os-ym7EwunyTMDieuRMb1","chapterId":"nUqlIIeavbsoCrRrvix2r","timelineId":"ST4jdjCPlD6GmgCHSK16K","title":"The Run In","description":"Teo hauls a glass-sled to Anchorage; the Needle flinches and Approach holds all traffic.","locationMarkerId":"wEhIauUyWZQf-aXny0I-E","involvedCharacterIds":["ba36zRukMnL6eifQ8p0Lp"],"involvedItemIds":["2vMXUX95ZfEKZDSeE_qQA","A3vCL9baC07vx-A_EYV4F","k_PyDBTlr9DQL7KZmc8hw"],"tags":[],"id":"m1shtvj-OXNak3rDkSDEs","sortOrder":-2,"createdAt":1793092538610,"updatedAt":1793092603512,"version":9,"remoteCharacterIds":["X6xy9-8XqigaVlg_V-Pe5"]},{"travelDays":0,"inWorldTime":null,"tension":4,"structureBeat":null,"status":"draft","povCharacterId":"ba36zRukMnL6eifQ8p0Lp","isFlashback":false,"mentionedCharacterIds":[],"threadIds":["FWVqEenkB0ukMB8QFSCGi","eO_7QOdp0avWbvEC7OOfX"],"motifIds":["gQ_6swqJ5lW3yGhmN9POY","uRRXouZ1ANkDsIh6wIm9O"],"worldId":"os-ym7EwunyTMDieuRMb1","chapterId":"hWwk3SB7ZaGrEanbf4VhQ","timelineId":"ST4jdjCPlD6GmgCHSK16K","title":"The Inner Markers","description":"Flying the shear-waves with Ambrose calling them; the buoy is dropped and opens like a flower; a wave from behind nearly drags the Mercy into the mouth.","locationMarkerId":"FcWrK3jWThBzOBiUAh7Is","involvedCharacterIds":["ba36zRukMnL6eifQ8p0Lp"